# Production environment for rMirror Cloud (see docs/deployment/hetzner.md).
# The full, always-current variable list is backend/.env.example (generated from
# backend/app/config.py). Start from that file:
#
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# For production, set at least: SECRET_KEY, DATABASE_URL (or the POSTGRES_* parts),
# DEBUG=false, CORS_ORIGINS, DASHBOARD_URL, the CLERK_* values, GOOGLE_AI_API_KEY,
# INTEGRATION_MASTER_KEY and the S3_* storage settings.
